Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 11:23:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] PhoneSwitcher: notify active data sub on single SIM

On single SIM devices using HAL_COMMAND_ALLOW_DATA, sendRilCommands()
sends no modem command, so onDdsSwitchResponse() never runs and
notifyPreferredDataSubIdChanged() is only reached through the "SIM
refresh" branch of onEvaluate(), which requires an unchanged preferred
data phone ID.

When the SIM becomes active after boot (hot insert, or a PIN locked SIM
unlocked later), the preferred data phone ID goes 0 -> -1 -> 0 while
the sub ID goes -1 -> 1, so TelephonyRegistry keeps an invalid active
data sub ID and SystemUI shows the mobile icon with an exclamation mark
although data works.

Notify when the preferred data sub ID changes together with the phone
ID in that configuration.

Test: m telephony-common FrameworksTelephonyTests
Assisted-by: LLM
Change-Id: I3565980ee6b123498ef02f6944660d4dff35f684
---
 .../telephony/data/PhoneSwitcher.java         |  5 +++++
 .../telephony/data/PhoneSwitcherTest.java     | 21 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 26 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/data/PhoneSwitcher.java b/src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/data/PhoneSwitcher.java
index 4d4f0a91fe3..5c568bffa36 100644
--- a/src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/data/PhoneSwitcher.java
+++ b/src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/data/PhoneSwitcher.java
@@ -1269,6 +1269,11 @@ protected boolean onEvaluate(boolean requestsChanged, String reason) {
             sb.append(" preferred data phoneId ").append(oldPreferredDataPhoneId)
                     .append("->").append(mPreferredDataPhoneId);
             diffDetected = true;
+            // Single SIM ALLOW_DATA sends no modem command, so onDdsSwitchResponse won't notify
+            if (mActiveModemCount == 1 && mHalCommandToUse != HAL_COMMAND_PREFERRED_DATA
+                    && oldPreferredDataSubId != mPreferredDataSubId.get()) {
+                notifyPreferredDataSubIdChanged();
+            }
         } else if (oldPreferredDataSubId != mPreferredDataSubId.get()) {
             logl("SIM refresh, notify dds change");
             // Inform connectivity about the active data phone
